  "cues": [
    {
      "start": 0.4,
      "end": 4.3125,
      "text": "Across Wrocław, bronze dwarves share poses and props."
    },
    {
      "start": 4.3125,
      "end": 7.75,
      "text": "Given a photograph, which individual statue are we looking at?"
    },
    {
      "start": 7.75,
      "end": 10.88,
      "text": "Meet Doppeldwarf-306."
    },
    {
      "start": 11.425,
      "end": 15.100000000000001,
      "text": "A frozen vision model turns each image into a vector: a"
    },
    {
      "start": 15.100000000000001,
      "end": 17.2875,
      "text": "numerical visual description."
    },
    {
      "start": 17.2875,
      "end": 20.25,
      "text": "Cosine similarity compares these vectors."
    },
    {
      "start": 20.25,
      "end": 23.15,
      "text": "Similar directions suggest similar appearance;"
    },
    {
      "start": 23.15,
      "end": 24.975,
      "text": "they do not prove identity."
    },
    {
      "start": 24.975,
      "end": 28.6625,
      "text": "We rank each statue by its best reference photograph, without"
    },
    {
      "start": 28.6625,
      "end": 30.38,
      "text": "fine-tuning the model."
    },
    {
      "start": 30.974999999999998,
      "end": 32.824999999999996,
      "text": "Now add more candidates."
    },
    {
      "start": 32.824999999999996,
      "end": 35.0375,
      "text": "Do lookalikes overwhelm retrieval?"
    },
    {
      "start": 35.0375,
      "end": 39.0,
      "text": "Instead of reporting one accuracy number, we repeatedly sample larger"
    },
    {
      "start": 39.0,
      "end": 42.724999999999994,
      "text": "candidate pools, always keeping the correct statue."
    },
    {
      "start": 42.724999999999994,
      "end": 45.3875,
      "text": "DINOv2 's accuracy falls slowly;"
    },
    {
      "start": 45.3875,
      "end": 47.0125,
      "text": "CLIP 's falls faster."
    },
    {
      "start": 47.0125,
      "end": 48.980000000000004,
      "text": "The curve is the result."
    },
    {
      "start": 49.55,
      "end": 51.625,
      "text": "Surely location solves this?"
    },
    {
      "start": 51.625,
      "end": 55.1875,
      "text": "But nearby lookalikes survive a hard geographic filter."
    },
    {
      "start": 55.1875,
      "end": 59.0625,
      "text": "In simulation, a soft distance bonus works better."
    },
    {
      "start": 59.0625,
      "end": 62.7125,
      "text": "Across 294 placed statues, DINOv2"
    },
    {
      "start": 62.7125,
      "end": 66.475,
      "text": "rises from 93.4 to 98.7"
    },
    {
      "start": 66.475,
      "end": 69.94666666666666,
      "text": "percent for users twenty-five metres away."
    },
    {
      "start": 70.49166666666667,
      "end": 74.55416666666667,
      "text": "A new photographer brings different viewpoints, backgrounds, and lighting."
    },
    {
      "start": 74.55416666666667,
      "end": 75.99166666666667,
      "text": "Accuracy drops."
    },
    {
      "start": 75.99166666666667,
      "end": 79.89166666666667,
      "text": "Fewer remaining reference photographs also contribute to that drop."
    },
    {
      "start": 79.89166666666667,
      "end": 83.71666666666667,
      "text": "Learned geometric matching checks whether local details line up,"
    },
    {
      "start": 83.71666666666667,
      "end": 85.30416666666667,
      "text": "improving the ranking."
    },
    {
      "start": 85.30416666666667,
      "end": 89.34666666666666,
      "text": "Classical SIFT adds no measurable gain in this comparison."
    },
    {
      "start": 89.89166666666668,
      "end": 93.65416666666667,
      "text": "Finally, high similarity need not mean a known statue."
    },
    {
      "start": 93.65416666666667,
      "end": 97.25416666666668,
      "text": "Comparing the best two candidates exposes ambiguity."
    },
    {
      "start": 97.25416666666668,
      "end": 100.61666666666667,
      "text": "This margin reduces false acceptance in the research;"
    },
    {
      "start": 100.61666666666667,
      "end": 104.74666666666666,
      "text": "the browser demo uses a separately measured close-call hint."
    },
    {
      "start": 105.26666666666667,
      "end": 108.75416666666666,
      "text": "The lesson: test the pool, the place, and the photographer."
    },
    {
      "start": 108.75416666666666,
      "end": 111.88,
      "text": "Explore the dataset, and try the identifier."
    }
  ],
